{
  "name": "identity",
  "class": "дубликаты и конфликты",
  "description": "Идентичность событий: повторная доставка той же записи, новый XADD с тем же event_id и содержимым (duplicate), с другим содержимым (conflict) и новая строка с тем же бизнес-содержимым, но новым event_id. Счётчики считают логические сообщения, агрегаты — только впервые принятые строки (TECHNICAL.md §4).",
  "question": "Одна и та же бизнес-строка пришла дважды с разными event_id. Что произошло с суммой total_amount_90d и со счётчиком order_count_90d и почему они ведут себя по-разному?",
  "input": {
    "observed_from": "2011-01-01",
    "observed_until": "2011-04-01",
    "reference_until": "2011-03-01"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Чистая среда: docker compose down -v && docker compose up -d --build --wait; начальные now=closed_until=2011-01-01 берутся из request.json (§5)."
    },
    {
      "op": "activate",
      "model_name": "hw4-logistic",
      "model_version": "1",
      "activation_id": "scen-identity-1"
    },
    {
      "op": "time",
      "now": "2011-01-12",
      "closed_until": "2011-01-01"
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-100",
        "invoice_id": "I900",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 2,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-10T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "10.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "received_total",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "attributed_new",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "duplicates",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "conflicts",
      "value": 0
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Повтор: новый XADD с тем же payload (тот же event_id e-100) — распознаётся как duplicate, состояние не меняется."
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-100",
        "invoice_id": "I900",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 2,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-10T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "10.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "received_total",
      "value": 2
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "duplicates",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "attributed_new",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Конфликт: тот же event_id e-100, другое содержимое (quantity 3) — отказ conflict."
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-100",
        "invoice_id": "I900",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 3,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-10T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "10.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "received_total",
      "value": 3
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "conflicts",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_rejection",
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "event",
      "reason": [
        "conflict",
        "content_mismatch"
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Новая строка: тот же бизнес-содержимое, новый event_id e-101 — принимается как отдельная строка (правило HW2)."
    },
    {
      "op": "event",
      "payload": {
        "event_id": "e-101",
        "invoice_id": "I900",
        "stock_code": "S1",
        "description": "item",
        "quantity": 2,
        "invoice_at": "2011-01-10T10:00:00",
        "unit_price": "10.000000",
        "customer_id": "A",
        "country": "GB"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "received_total",
      "value": 4
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "attributed_new",
      "value": 2
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_status",
      "field": "duplicates",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "op": "request",
      "payload": {
        "request_id": "r-id-1",
        "client_id": "A",
        "as_of": "2011-01-12"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "wait_boundary"
    },
    {
      "op": "expect_prediction",
      "request_id": "r-id-1",
      "status": "ok",
      "features": {
        "order_count_90d": 1,
        "total_amount_90d": "40.000000",
        "average_order_amount_90d": "40.00",
        "days_since_last_order": 2,
        "distinct_stock_codes_90d": 1,
        "return_rate_90d": "0.000000",
        "order_count_30d": 1,
        "total_amount_30d": "40.000000"
      },
      "model_name": "hw4-logistic",
      "model_version": "1",
      "probability": 0.6949730859641007
    },
    {
      "op": "note",
      "text": "Сумма удвоилась (2 строки по 20.000000), а order_count_90d остался 1: счётчик считает различные invoice_id (§3)."
    }
  ]
}
